WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.724
One day Ali went to a dinner party at his friend's house.

2
00:00:11.725 --> 00:00:16.407
There were four guests including Ali.

3
00:00:16.408 --> 00:00:20.617
Two of them were merchants.

4
00:00:20.618 --> 00:00:24.837
And the third was a government official.

5
00:00:24.838 --> 00:00:32.269
Ali did not know the merchants, but he recognized the government official.

6
00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:39.421
People said that this man was dishonest and a thief.

7
00:00:39.422 --> 00:00:46.448
But Ali was wise and did not believe everything he heard.

8
00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:52.898
The men were hungry.

9
00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:59.973
As they waited for dinner, they chatted pleasantly.

10
00:00:59.974 --> 00:01:04.592
Ali's friend served many delicious things to eat.

11
00:01:04.593 --> 00:01:12.860
There was soup, rice, meats, and many kinds of fruit.

12
00:01:12.861 --> 00:01:21.752
But when it was time to eat, Ali's friend excused himself.

13
00:01:21.753 --> 00:01:28.575
"I am sorry," said the host, "but my son was in a terrible accident.

14
00:01:28.576 --> 00:01:33.090
I must go to him, so I cannot eat with you.

15
00:01:33.091 --> 00:01:35.485
Please enjoy yourselves and eat freely.

16
00:01:35.486 --> 00:01:40.175
I only ask that you pray for my son."

17
00:01:40.176 --> 00:01:45.040
The host left with those words.

18
00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:49.767
Before they ate, the guests all prayed to Allah.

19
00:01:49.768 --> 00:01:53.897
The government official sat next to Ali.

20
00:01:53.898 --> 00:01:59.140
He was eating very fast.

21
00:01:59.141 --> 00:02:03.254
He was stuffing his mouth and his pockets with food.

22
00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:08.695
He filled his pockets with everything he could reach.

23
00:02:08.696 --> 00:02:12.705
The two merchants stared at the government official.

24
00:02:12.706 --> 00:02:15.919
They were shocked by his behavior.

25
00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:19.067
They were strangers to this town.

26
00:02:19.068 --> 00:02:25.393
So they did not say anything to the rude official.

27
00:02:25.394 --> 00:02:30.196
Ali quietly picked up a teapot.

28
00:02:30.197 --> 00:02:35.562
He poured tea into the man's pocket.

29
00:02:35.563 --> 00:02:40.642
The man started shouting at Ali.

30
00:02:40.643 --> 00:02:41.850
"What are you doing?

31
00:02:41.851 --> 00:02:46.411
Are you crazy?" he said angrily.

32
00:02:46.412 --> 00:02:50.049
"Excuse me," answered Ali.

33
00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.015
"I saw that your pockets were hungry.

34
00:02:52.016 --> 00:02:56.074
I thought they might be thirsty too."

35
00:02:56.075 --> 00:03:06.329
The government official was embarrassed and said nothing more.

